				</ukm:Metadata><Secondary><Body DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/body" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/body" NumberOfProvisions="11" RestrictExtent="E+W+S+N.I." RestrictStartDate="2026-06-15"><P1group RestrictExtent="E+W+S+N.I." RestrictStartDate="2026-06-15"><Title>Citation, commencement and effect</Title><P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/article/1" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1" id="article-1"><Pnumber><CommentaryRef Ref="key-a1"/>1</Pnumber><P1para><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/article/1/1" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/1" id="article-1-1"><Pnumber>1</Pnumber><P2para><Text>This Order may be cited as the Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Temporary Continuation of 2022 Order and Adjustments) Order 2026 and comes into force on 23rd March 2026.</Text></P2para></P2><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/article/1/2" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/2" id="article-1-2"><Pnumber>2</Pnumber><P2para><Text>Article 3 has effect in relation to products charged with duty under the Oil Act in the period beginning with 23rd March 2026 and ending with <Substitution ChangeId="key-a2" CommentaryRef="key-a2">31st December 2026</Substitution>.</Text></P2para></P2><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/article/1/3" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/3" id="article-1-3"><Pnumber><CommentaryRef Ref="key-a3"/>3</Pnumber><P2para><Text>. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .</Text></P2para></P2><P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/164/article/1/4" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/4" id="article-1-4"><Pnumber>4</Pnumber><P2para><Text><Span>Articles 8 to 11</Span> have effect in relation to products charged with duty under the Oil Act in the period beginning with <Substitution ChangeId="key-a4" CommentaryRef="key-a4">1st January 2027</Substitution> and ending with 28th February 2027.</Text></P2para></P2></P1para></P1></P1group></Body></Secondary><Commentaries><Commentary Type="I" id="key-a1"><Para><Text>Art. 1  in force at 23.3.2026, see <CitationSubRef id="n263f0d96f375bf91" SectionRef="article-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/164/article/1/1" Operative="true">art. 1(1)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a2" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in art. 1(2) substituted (15.6.2026) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555" id="c9ve9ss96-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2026" Number="555" Title="The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026">The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/555)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="c9ve9ss96-00007" id="c9ve9ss96-00008" SectionRef="article-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/1/1">arts. 1(1)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="c9ve9ss96-00007" id="c9ve9ss96-00009" SectionRef="article-2-2-a" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/a" Operative="true">2(2)(a)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a3" Type="F"><Para><Text>Art. 1(3) omitted (15.6.2026) by virtue of <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555" id="c9ve9ss96-00014" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2026" Number="555" Title="The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026">The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Amendment) Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/555)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="c9ve9ss96-00014" id="c9ve9ss96-00015" SectionRef="article-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/arti